  "content": "<p>本期电台是计划中的第二期电台，在去年十月就说好要录了。今年<span></span>4<span></span>月<span></span>13<span></span>号开始录制，期间发生重大事故，最后在<span></span>5<span></span>月<span></span>20<span></span>号才剪辑<span></span>/<span></span>抢救完毕。</p>\n<p>另外，经主播长提议，本电台更名为“双贝子电台<span>”</span>。</p>\n<h2>在线收听</h2>\n<div>\n<p>\n    📢：也可以用<span></span>AntennaPod<span></span>或苹果播客订阅本播客<span></span>RSS<span></span>地址（<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/podcast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://emptystack.top/podcast</a>）来收听！\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/1000018877-01.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"本期播客封面：蓝色的迷雾包裹着蓝色的吸尘器\" height=\"1396\" width=\"1395\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    你的浏览器不支持嵌入音频，但你可以<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载</a>下来听。\n    视频内容：俩闲人聊盯鞋音乐\n\n<p>噪音预警<br>\nPanchiko\n– D&gt;E&gt;A&gt;T&gt;H&gt;M&gt;E&gt;T&gt;A&gt;L<br>\n开场<br>\nThe\nRaveonettes – Dead Sound<br>\n主播长在北京的冬天听《Dead\nSound》<br>\n首钢是后黄金时代的环保圣地<br>\n主播长在首钢园外追星失败<br>\n3D<span></span>眼镜<br>\nMira\n– When You Sleep<br>\n尝试解释<span></span>Shoegaze<span></span>和<span></span>Dream\nPop<br>\nmy\nbloody valentine – when you sleep<br>\n马鲛鱼为大家带来极致的耳膜享受——从四面八方唠一小时<span></span>my\nbloody valentine<br>\n主播长终于听完了马鲛鱼的唠叨，认为《when\nyou sleep》是《loveless》里唯一能听的歌<br>\n马鲛鱼\n– only tomorrow<br>\n马鲛鱼简单介绍下<span></span>only\ntomorrow<br>\nyourboyfriendsucks!\n– Intro (Just Like Honey)<br>\n主播长在武汉某封面展的见闻<br>\n马鲛鱼回忆第一次听<span></span>yourboyfriendsucks!<span></span>那天吃的纳豆<br>\nSweet\nTrip – Chocolate Matter<br>\n马鲛鱼认识到他需要和<span></span>mbv<span></span>相似又不同的声音<br>\nThe\nJesus and Mary Chain – April Skies<br>\n主播长简单介绍<span></span>JAMC<br>\nJAMC<span></span>的“抽象”访谈<br>\n马鲛鱼的<span></span>JAMC<span></span>现场见闻<br>\npasteboard\n– Breakbeats<br>\n主播长怒斥日本盯鞋乐队太有文化<br>\n主播长认为<span></span>Breakbeats<span></span>的吉他声有北京腔<br>\n尝试探讨<span></span>Tokyo\nShoegazer<span></span>的汉字为什么是东京酒吐座<br>\n驱使马鲛鱼第一次听<span></span>mbv<span></span>的其实就是日本人的《Yellow\nLoveless》<br>\n主播长评价广东<span></span>Shoegazer<br>\n<span>《</span>Train》的歌词与火车在电影中的意象<br>\nChestnut\nBakery – Train</p>\n</div>\n<h2>扩展</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sYjMVb74xfU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Panchiko<span></span>重见天日的故事</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://casouri.github.io/rock/day/collection/day-121.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">D&gt;E&gt;A&gt;T&gt;H&gt;M&gt;E&gt;T&gt;A&gt;L<span></span>的赏析</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://archive.fo/vmjfw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">附带<span></span>3D<span></span>眼镜的《Lust\nLust Lust》</a></li>\n<li>Fender<span></span>在<span></span>Jazzmaster\n60<span></span>周年时采访<span></span>Kevin\nSheilds：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qd1Xmr2YY7c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">第一部分</a>、<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gxkzYCT2NGM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">第二部分</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/MyBloodyValentine/comments/sz3suo/guitar_magazine_japan_full_scan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">采访<span></span>Kevin\nShields<span></span>的那期《Guitar》杂志</a>。其中记录了<span></span>Sonic\nYouth<span></span>在和<span></span>JAMC<span></span>共演时第一次认识了垫场的<span></span>mbv。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/612070?l=schinese\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">由史悲和<span></span>Light<span></span>共同制作的《Kio<span></span>的人间冒险》</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Primal_Scream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">只敲两个鼓的<span></span>JAMC<span></span>初代鼓手后来成立了大名鼎鼎的<span></span>Primal\nScream</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.setlist.fm/setlist/the-jesus-and-mary-chain/2024/usher-hall-edinburgh-scotland-3aa4d23.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2024<span></span>年<span></span>3<span></span>月，JAMC<span></span>在爱丁堡的<span></span>setlist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tokyoshoegazer.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tokyo\nShoegazer<span></span>的专辑封面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hitsujibungaku.info/disco/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">羊文学的专辑</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J7laguPTT-Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">历史上第一部电影：<span>《</span>L&#x27;Arrivée d&#x27;un train\nen gare de La Ciotat》</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ss4y1p7dm/?p=22&amp;t=480\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">贝托鲁奇《一九〇〇》的结尾</a></li>\n</ol>\n<h2>幕后花絮</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/Screenshot_20240521-162909~2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"主播长表示越难听就越好听\" height=\"412\" width=\"864\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n\n\n    <div>\n        <span>互动</span>\n        <div>复制以下链接，并粘贴到你的联邦宇宙Fediverse应用的搜索栏中，即可搜到对应本文的嘟文。对嘟文进行的点赞、转发、评论，都会出现在本文底部。快去试试吧！</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <span></span>\n        <div>链接：<code>https://emptystack.top/note/vacuum</code></div>\n    </div>\n\n<div>\n    \n\n\n\n<br>\n\n    \n\n\n\n\n一人赞过\n    <ol>\n        \n        <li>\n\n\n\n\n\n黑糖 :splat_golden_egg:</li>\n        \n    </ol>\n\n\n\n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n    \n\n\n两\n\n\n二条评论\n    <ol>\n        \n        <li>\n            <figure>\n                <figcaption><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/users/sabrinalin/statuses/112480803633328360\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://mastodon.social/users/sabrinalin</a>：\n                </figcaption>\n                \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                <blockquote><p><span><a href=\"https://emptystack.top/actor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@<span>actor</span></a></span> 表扬这位同学每周末坚持剪音频并反复修改耗时一个多月！希望他可以一直有热爱的